==Icelandic==
{{Icelandic declension kk sb bróðir|móður}}

===Etymology===
From {{gen}} of ''[[móðir#Icelandic|móðir]]'' meaning "[[mother]]" (= ''[[móður]]'' meaning "of a mother") + ''[[bróðir#Icelandic|bróðir]]'' meaning "[[brother#English|brother]]". Literally meaning "brother of a mother" or "mother's brother".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/mou.δʏr.brou.δɪr/|lang=is}}

